{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/4/6746718f613085df2dcb113f888906946fdc70e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{x-1} = \\frac{y^2 + 2y - 1}{y^2 + 2y - 2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"167\" height=\"42\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e33f153a995fdf6a368f770b192a86e69a6ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad y^2 + 2y - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/9/3d93e5f7040d8c08fb78595f57604e686219af44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)} \\quad y^2 + 2y - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e5389e4cf3531469eb9c621d4b5a6241525c6b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)} \\quad y^2 + 2y + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/007ace66599b451e858a6fcd97edcd2912584bee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad y^2 + 2y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41057e1aaf0961f438af753a2aaf2541a7884b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)} \\quad -y^2 - 2y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cross-multiply and simplify:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6ade39e0e30d561d34f1f7a0424ed8739d21096.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(y^2 + 2y - 2) = (x-1)(y^2 + 2y - 1)\\]\" width=\"295\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b18b6e7b030feff8a95e7a5c02757e52089beab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy^2 + 2xy - 2x = xy^2 + 2xy - x - y^2 - 2y + 1\\]\" width=\"365\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/7/5373f3f1b1cd03df689803c0bacc077d10c8bac5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-x = -y^2 - 2y + 1\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92fd07b27b67838f3fff61ea348dd7a6d10e7ab5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\boxed{(\\textbf{A})\\ y^2 + 2y - 1}\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/0/da0bac26d914fec5f90e2d1404ea71fcd52c6c68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{x-1} = \\frac{y^2+2y-1}{y^2+2y-2} \\Rightarrow \\frac{x+(x-1)}{x-(x-1)} = \\frac{(y^2+2y-1)+(y^2+2y-2)}{(y^2+2y-1)-(y^2+2y-2)}\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d7fe46f83a6dc83709d15ee1c53f29c36676b0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2x-1}{1} = \\frac{2y^2+4y-3}{1} \\Rightarrow 2x-1 = 2y^2+4y-3 \\Rightarrow x = y^2+2y-1\\]\" width=\"532\" height=\"39\" />\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trashboycan&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Trashboycan (page does not exist)\">Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title